/Title (Administrators manage the overall system and ensure its smooth operation. They monitor registered users, manage user accounts, oversee application usage, maintain system integrity, and ensure that AI-powered services function correctly. Administrators also have permission to perform system-level management tasks and resolve user-related issues.)
